  "headline": "FDA's records show the methylprednisolone acetate shortage has been listed since 2021-12-15 and remains current as of 2026-10-21",
  "headline_cites": ["E27", "D8"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA first posted the methylprednisolone acetate injection shortage on 2021-12-15 and it remains current as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["E27", "D8"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Multiple manufacturers including Amneal Pharmaceuticals, Eugia US LLC, Par Health USA LLC, Pfizer Inc., and Sagent Pharmaceuticals are listed with current shortage status.",
      "cites": ["E22", "E23", "E24", "E25", "E26"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The most recent FDA update for Amneal Pharmaceuticals was 2026-10-06 with estimated recovery late October 2026/November 2026.",
      "cites": ["E22"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Eugia US LLC updated 2026-10-19 with recovery TBD and advises checking wholesalers for inventory.",
      "cites": ["E23"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Pfizer Inc. updated 2026-09-21 and Sagent Pharmaceuticals updated 2026-10-08, both remain current.",
      "cites": ["E25", "E26"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule-based transfer option ranked 1 moves 27 units from Corvale General (23 days on hand) to Corvale Lakeside (7 days on hand) which would reach 14 days.",
